    ["Punching tool","CUT","The alternative. The film lies on a cutting plate and the punch is pressed through it into the die."],
    ["Punching zone","PROCESS","Mechanical cutting is fast but risks deflection, cracks and delamination of the film."],
    ["Elementary cell","PRODUCT","Anode, electrolyte and cathode as one trimmed unit, ready to stack. Dimensions join edge quality as a graded feature here."]],
