    ["Laser welder","CONTACT","Laser beam welding, under 4 000 W. Low contact resistance of the welds and low thermal stress are both graded."],
    ["Stacked cell stack","WORKPIECE","For a bipolar stack only the two outer current conductors need to be led out — the series connection is internal."],
    ["Deep-drawn film","FORM","A metal–plastic composite foil, drawn under 10 mm deep, electrically insulated."],
    ["Sealing","CLOSE","Impulse or contact seals close the package completely. Strength and tightness of the seam are what keep the environment out."],
    ["No filling port","NOTE","The electrolyte filling that follows sealing in lithium-ion production is not required here. A whole station, a dry room and a wetting queue disappear."]],
  params:["Welding speed","Pulse frequency","Laser power under 4 000 W","Spot size","Sealing time, temperature and pressure","Pouch deep-drawing depth under 10 mm"],
  alts:["Ultrasonic welding"],
  chall:["Possible damage during welding"],
  qInf:["Possible damage during welding","Volume changes during loading and unloading"],
  qFeat:["Low mechanical and thermal stress during welding","Low contact resistance of the welds","Strength and tightness of the sealed seam"],
  sop:["Position the stack and locate the conductors","Set laser power and spot for the weld","Weld and measure contact resistance","Deep-draw the pouch film","Insert, insulate and fix the conductors","Seal and leak-check the seam"] },

